# SHA-256 manifest -- browser-side provider parsing, research evidence
#
# Recorded 2026-08-14 from the per-session scratch directories
#   .../scratchpad/agent-{t1,t2,t3,u1,u2}/
# where these reports were written. Those directories are temporary by
# construction; the copies beside this manifest are the surviving record.
#
# Each copy was verified byte-identical to its source with `cmp` at copy time.
# The digests exist so a later reader can tell whether a file here has been
# edited since -- these reports carry retracted claims and inter-report
# contradictions on purpose, and silently tidying them would destroy the thing
# they are kept for.
#
# Verify (should print 5x OK and nothing else):
#   shasum -a 256 -c MANIFEST.sha256
#
# README.md is deliberately absent: it was written here, it is not preserved
# evidence, and it is expected to change.
#
